<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.vessel.founds ~ the founding: identity, persona zero, the planes and the bootstrap

`lares vessel found` mints the vessel identity, the social planes and the bootstrap and skips what already stands. `--hearth --name '<label>'` founds a hearth with persona zero and its one-seat seed charter; `--hearth --restore <bundle>` founds it with a restored face as persona zero; bare, it founds a place with no face, which joins one by `lares fleet join`. `--chair <label>` names persona zero's private chair label; `--genesis <dir>` the genesis it founds from; `--storage <dir>` the store; `--root <dir>` the vessel root. The human route reads on a terminal (passphrase, paper pin); with none the founding refuses by name. `--force` over a founded hearth re-seeds the bootstrap, so the house hand gate reads the branch first.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ hearth · place · restore

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`hearth` params=`hearth/true name/[[Mara]] ~ found a hearth with persona zero`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`place` params=`~ found a place with no face`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`restore` params=`hearth/true restore/backup.json ~ found from a backup bundle`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ hearth · name · restore · chair · genesis · storage · root · force

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`hearth` params=`kind/switch ~ found a hearth with persona zero and its seed charter`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`name` params=`takes/label ~ persona zero's private label; a hearth founding needs it unless restore= names a bundle`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`restore` params=`takes/host-path ~ found with a restored face from this backup bundle as persona zero`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`chair` params=`takes/label ~ persona zero's private chair label`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`genesis` params=`takes/dir ~ the genesis dir the founding reads`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`storage` params=`takes/dir ~ the store the founding writes`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`root` params=`takes/dir ~ the vessel root (LAR_ROOT) this call reads`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`force` params=`kind/switch ~ re-seed the bootstrap over a founded hearth; a hand act`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand ~ mints keys on this host; the human route reads a terminal, and --force reads the hand gate`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ HearthFoundingRefused · OccupiedStoreRefusal · hand-act-only · hand-unattested

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`HearthFoundingRefused` params=`cure/[[engine.vessel.founds hearth/true name/<label>]] ~ persona zero needs a label, or the bundle reads unreadable, malformed or opens no route; nothing landed`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`OccupiedStoreRefusal` params=`~ the store holds a carrier and no tree; nothing mints over it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`hand-act-only` params=`~ an AI seat stands on the branch; --force runs on a person's own terminal`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`hand-unattested` params=`~ the hand gate read no chain for the branch`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ founded · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`founded` params=`exit/0 ~ the vessel stands founded, or already stood`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/1 ~ the founding refused by name; the act wrote nothing`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

